  nonce: 8a0a  # 8a0a
  message: "WORK DONE 2026-10-03 (decontend stage 7), branch jgstern-agent/fix/vinuh, commit 8da3b291eb (local, not pushed; shared with WI-nulig-gipot-samir-movik-latuj-tizin-vagig-lorup). Report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/vinuh.md.\n\nMechanism: the chained-call branch now types the receiver with _go_call_result_type (the binding typer's own rule, NewXxx convention then return-type registry, extracted into _go_registry_call_type and shared), and an out-of-module result type fills the slot as a typed local's does. library_signatures/go.yaml: slog.New / slog.Default / slog.With -> slog.Logger. Also: a receiver whose type is known to be outside the module (a call result, a stdlib package variable, a struct field) is no longer looked up in-repo (receiver_type_is_external) -- an internal/http X.Do took http.DefaultClient.Do and an internal/json Enc.Encode took json.NewEncoder(w).Encode.\n\nLive: slog.New(h).Error -> go:log/slog.Logger:0-0:Error (io: logging log/slog.Logger.Error, was log/slog.Error); l := slog.New(h); l.Error -> same (was go:external, unclassified); json.NewEncoder(w).Encode -> go:encoding/json.Encoder:0-0:Encode (= the bound form). Corpus A/B by call site (alertmanager, prometheus, otel-collector; frozen copies, own XDG caches): 0 sites lost; changed 54/97/96; io-boundaries: no classified boundary lost; prometheus scrape.go:1394 (the filed instance) now log/slog.Logger.Error. Targeted smart-test: 13005 passed, 0 failed, changed sources at 100%."  # 8a0a
